* @title Gimpel day-of-week function
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapter 2.8; Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @expect >>>
* WEDNESDAY
* 3
* THURSDAY
* TUESDAY
* FRIDAY
* MONDAY
* <<<
-INCLUDE "DAY.INC"
	OUTPUT = DAY('3/24/71')
	OUTPUT = D
	OUTPUT = DAY('3/24/1825')
	OUTPUT = DAY('2/29/2000')
	OUTPUT = DAY('1/1/1904')
	OUTPUT = DAY('12/25/2023')
END
